@JerseyStore.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Health check
GET {{JerseyStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Public product catalog
GET {{JerseyStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1
Accept: application/json

### Administrator login
POST {{JerseyStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "<configured-admin-email>",
  "password": "<configured-admin-password>"
}

### Set this to the accessToken returned by login
@adminToken = <paste-access-token>
@productId = 11
@variantId = 1

### Current administrator
GET {{JerseyStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### List all products for administration
GET {{JerseyStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create product
POST {{JerseyStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "chelsea-2030-31-home",
  "name": "Chelsea 2030/31 Home Jersey",
  "club": "Chelsea",
  "season": "2030/31",
  "kitType": "Home",
  "description": "Blue home jersey.",
  "displayOrder": 20,
  "isActive": true,
  "variants": [
    { "size": "M", "sizeOrder": 2, "price": 350, "stock": 5, "sku": "CHELSEA-M", "isActive": true }
  ]
}

### Get an admin product
GET {{JerseyStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Update product (include variant IDs from the admin product response)
PUT {{JerseyStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "chelsea-2030-31-home",
  "name": "Chelsea 2030/31 Home Jersey",
  "club": "Chelsea",
  "season": "2030/31",
  "kitType": "Home",
  "description": "Updated blue home jersey.",
  "displayOrder": 20,
  "isActive": true,
  "variants": [
    { "id": {{variantId}}, "size": "M", "sizeOrder": 2, "price": 360, "stock": 5, "sku": "CHELSEA-M", "isActive": true }
  ]
}

### Update variant stock
PATCH {{JerseyStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/products/{{productId}}/variants/{{variantId}}/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": 8
}

### Upload an image (replace ./sample-shirt.png with a valid local image)
POST {{JerseyStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/products/{{productId}}/images
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=JerseyStoreBoundary

--JerseyStoreBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="altText"

Chelsea home shirt
--JerseyStoreBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample-shirt.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./sample-shirt.png
--JerseyStoreBoundary--

### Delete product (use an existing ID; a missing ID returns 404)
DELETE {{JerseyStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
